==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Demon Gory|Demon Gories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage, use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cats]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cats]] to swarm Master A. and claim your victory.

